  "name": "Elemental Shard (Moderate)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell (add 1 action)</p><hr><p>These crystals are crushed variants of @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.equipment.ZCcpPbqOiTaAOHCZ]{Elemental Crystals}. The elemental crystal used dictates the damage type required by the spell for the shards to be used as a catalyst, while the purity of the elemental crystal dictates its potency. The shard gains the trait affiliated with that element. When activated for a spell that deals a matching damage type as the crystal’s aspected element, the spell deals an additional damage of that type to a single target. For example, a fire shard is used as a catalyst for spells that deal fire damage.</p><p><strong>Minor</strong> The spell deals an additional 3 damage.</p>"
    },
